<p>CSS theme was written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/inithello" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1310208); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1310208&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1501103466" alt="InitHello" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1310208)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/inithello" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1310208); return false;">InitHello</a></span> and you can read about its licensing/etc. info <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-1663880/breach-my-containment-baby#post-2723547">here.</a></p>

